OL,3,GNEWSA'Sheepdog Olympics' come to the
OL,4,AScottish Borders
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of dog handlers from 34
OL,7,Fdifferent nations are in the Scottish
OL,8,FBorders for what has been described as
OL,9,Fthe "sheepdog Olympics".
OL,11,FThe Sheepdog World Trial 2026 started
OL,12,Fon Wednesday at Huntington Farm near
OL,13,FLauder and runs until Sunday.
OL,15,FTens of thousands of spectators are
OL,16,Fexpected for an event which has seen
OL,17,Frecord entries with competitors come
OL,18,Ffrom as far as Japan and South Africa.
OL,20,FThe first rounds have started ahead of
OL,21,FSunday's final, with all the events
OL,22,Fbeing live-streamed around the world.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
